# Repository conventions

The conventions for this repository are defined in @CLAUDE.md. Read it and follow it as written.

It covers ownership and AI attribution, git workflow, branch naming, commit message format, PR descriptions, testing before handoff, and the handoff format.

`CLAUDE.md` is the single source of truth. Do not restate its rules here: duplicating them is what this reference exists to avoid, and a copy that drifts is worse than no copy.
